Third-party material
--------------------

src/spoolmix/mixer_coeffs.py
  FilamentMixer degree-4 polynomial coefficients, generated by
  scripts/gen_mixer_coeffs.py from cpp/filament_mixer.h in
  https://github.com/justinh-rahb/filament-mixer
  (commit 22a23e9ed479f06b4ab57998b82f5e08093bb406).
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Justin Hayes.
  The same coefficients ship in Snapmaker Orca as
  src/libslic3r/filament_mixer_model.h (also under that MIT notice).

Snapmaker Orca / Full Spectrum (https://github.com/Snapmaker/OrcaSlicer,
AGPL-3.0) was studied to reproduce its color prediction and search behavior.
No AGPL source code is included in spoolmix; the mixing pipeline and search
are independent reimplementations from that description.

td_database.yaml / catalog.yaml contain factual data (hex colors, TD values)
gathered from the sources cited on each entry.
